# Canonical skills and rules

Product bodies live in nested repos. Analytics root only keeps thin pointers.

| Area | Canonical home |
|------|----------------|
| C# / LAP / IAP | `MicroService.IAP/MicroService.IAP/.cursor/` (`docs/`, `rules/`, `skills/`) |
| WebUI | `Web/WebUI/.agents/` and `Web/WebUI/.cursor/rules/` |

Rule bodies live in `docs/`; rules only point. Skills are **manual** (`disable-model-invocation: true`). New body → product repo; here → wrapper + [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) row.
